# Claude AI Rules for this project
# This file customizes how Claude behaves in this workspace
# Similar to Cursor's .cursorrules

## Code Style
- Use TypeScript strict mode
- Prefer functional components in React
- Use async/await instead of promises.then()
- Add JSDoc comments to all exported functions

## Framework-Specific
- This is a Next.js project, use App Router conventions
- Use Server Components by default, Client Components only when needed
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling

## Best Practices
- Write tests for all new features
- Follow the existing folder structure in src/
- Use meaningful variable names
- Keep functions small and focused

## Restrictions
- Never use 'any' type in TypeScript
- Don't install new packages without asking
- Always show diff preview before applying changes

